# Environment

Copy to `.env` for local development. Never commit real secrets.

```env
# Required only for DB tooling (drizzle-kit push). The portfolio site and the
# health-only API server run without it.
DATABASE_URL=

# Optional local overrides (Replit artifact runtime provides these in prod).
PORT=5173
BASE_PATH=/
LOG_LEVEL=info
NODE_ENV=development

# Contact form (server): only needed if you re-add a server-side contact
# endpoint. The current Web3Forms-based form posts directly from the browser
# and needs none of these — RESEND_API_KEY / TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY are
# documented here for the upgrade path only. Never expose them to the client.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional sender override; must be an address on a domain verified in Resend.
# RESEND_FROM=
# Cloudflare Turnstile secret key (server-only).
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
# Comma-separated production portfolio origin(s) allowed by the API's CORS
# policy, e.g. ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-portfolio-domain.com
# (localhost dev origins are allowed automatically).
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=

# Contact form (frontend, Vite): public values, safe to expose in the client.
# Web3Forms access key from https://web3forms.com — free, no account signup,
# just enter your inbox (piyush_in_tech@gmail.com) to get a key.
# The key only authorises sends to your inbox; spam is handled by Web3Forms
# (botcheck honeypot + rate limiting, optional captcha toggle on their
# dashboard). Free tier: 250 submissions/month.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
```
